DTEND:20240215T020000
DTSTAMP:20261027T170709Z
UID:74d4783e48ca710c2476f9d61bcb4d@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:MOBA is the world's only museum dedicated to the collection\, 
 exhibition\, and celebration of art that would not be welcomed to any trad
 itional art museum. Our collection includes sincere art in which something
  has gone wrong in a way that results in a compelling\, interesting image.
  Hours: Sunday / Monday 11:30am - 9pm Tuesday through Thursday 11:30am -10
 pm Friday / Saturday 11:30am - 11pm Admission: free\n\nSources: Meet Bosto
 n\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/museum-of-bad-art/79503/
LOCATION:Dorchester Brewing Co.\, Dorchester Brewing Co. 1250 Massachusett
 s Ave\, MA\, 02125
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/museum-of-bad-art/79503/
END:VEVENT
