DESCRIPTION:Turn your phone into a personal tour guide - explore Boston an
 d its surroundings! This self-guided walking tour bundle includes Boston F
 reedom Trail (Old North Church\, Faneuil Hall\, & more)\, Harvard Universi
 ty’s main campus in Cambridge\, the historic Boston harbor tour along th
 e Harborwalk\, and the Boston Ghost tour. This is the ultimate “must-do
 ” package for a trip to Boston and New England. Boston Freedom Trail Sel
 f-Guided Tour Walk in the footsteps of Revolutionary War heroes\, discover
  the story of Paul Revere’s Midnight Ride\, and relive the fight for Ame
 rican Independence with a self-guided tour of the Boston Freedom Trail! Th
 is is one of our bestselling tours on TripAdvisor\, Expedia\, and Viator. 
 Boston Harbor Tour Immerse yourself in the stories of the American Revolut
 ion\, Boston Tea Party\, and Sons of Liberty as you stroll along Boston’
 s scenic Harborwalk! Unearth tales of rebellion\, sabotage\, and intrigue 
 surrounding the Founding Fathers. Boston Ghost Tour This bone-chilling sel
 f-guided walking tour through Boston’s otherworldly side begins at Boyls
 ton Street Station\, where a gas explosion killed several workers.\n\nSour
 ces: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/gps-self-gu
 ided-audio-tours/65219/
