DESCRIPTION:Embark on our best-selling and highly sought-after Sunset Tour
 \, where you'll be treated to an extraordinary first-class helicopter expe
 rience in Boston. Prepare to be captivated as you witness the city's trans
 formation under the warm hues of a breathtaking sunset. As you embark on t
 his exclusive journey\, our helicopter will take you on a scenic route ove
 r the Boston Harbor Islands and the vast expanse of the Atlantic Ocean. Ma
 rvel at the stunning views of the islands below\, each one holding its own
  unique charm and natural beauty. Cruise your way into the city\, where th
 e majestic Boston skyline awaits. Tour Highlights: Sunset Helicopter Tour 
 showcasing the breathtaking beauty of Boston\, including the Boston Harbor
  Islands and Atlantic Ocean Ample opportunities for capturing stunning sun
