 ur guided walking tours of Lexington Battle Green are available on Fridays
 \, Saturdays\, and Sundays. Walk in\, or book online. Private tours of the
  Battle Green and surrounding area are also available. Contact us at 781-6
 98-4568 to arrange a one-of-kind experience today! Our tours begin at the 
