UID:1875198782280a9574d7f575402608@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Embark on a delicious journey through America’s “City of P
 residents” where history meets incredible flavors! Now home to a thrivin
 g\, diverse community\, Quincy is particularly renowned for being the birt
 hplace of two U.S. presidents\, John Adams and John Quincy Adams. Beyond i
 ts presidential ties\, Quincy has a history intertwined with industry\, in
 cluding a granite quarrying industry and a significant shipbuilding center
 . Join our expert local guides for an unforgettable 2-hour walking adventu
 re through the heart of Quincy’s vibrant food scene. This intimate small
 -group tour takes you beyond the typical tourist spots to discover the aut
 hentic tastes that make this historic city special and weaves together the
  Presidential stories and sites. Why Choose Off The Beaten Path Food Tours
 ? ✓ TripAdvisor Certificate of Excellence winner ✓ 5-star average rati
 ng from delighted guests ✓ Local expertise from guides who live and brea
 the Quincy ✓ 95% of our guests book directly with us for the authentic e
 xperience Book now and taste why Quincy is Boston’s best-kept culinary s
 ecret!\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/eve
 nt/quincy-ma-presidential-food-tour/87292/
