 eries of exercises and mini projects – leading up to a full scale painti
 ng. This is very beginner focused and allows time for hands-on instruction
 . The areas of focus for the classes are: -The differences and common lang
 uage to know when choosing your materials. -How to achieve different washe
 s and manage the amount of water on your paper. -Color theory basics and h
 ow that translates to a transparent medium. -Embracing the medium's unique
