 al goods\, including stunning jewelry\, fashion accessories\, pottery\, an
 d one-of-a-kind home decor. Whether you're on the hunt for a special gift 
 or simply want to treat yourself\, the Boston Open Market has something fo
 r everyone. Come join us and discover the best of Boston's local talent!\n
