DESCRIPTION:Join Trademark Tours for our MIT Tour and learn about the hist
 ory\, innovation\, culture\, and student life of one of the world’s most
  influential universities. The MIT Tour MIT student guides greet you on ca
 mpus and lead you through an engaging\, informative\, and entertaining exp
 erience. Along the way\, guests explore some of MIT’s most recognizable 
 spaces\, including Killian Court\, the Great Dome\, the Stata Center\, the
  MIT Media Lab\, the Green Building\, and the Infinite Corridor. The tour 
 highlights MIT’s role in science\, technology\, engineering\, entreprene
 urship\, and global innovation\, while also giving guests a look at everyd
 ay student life on campus. Our tours are led in English. For guests who do
  not speak English\, we also provide complimentary written translations in
  Spanish and Simplified Chinese\, allowing guests to read along during the
  tour. Tour themes include MIT history\, campus culture\, student traditio
 ns\, famous MIT figures\, groundbreaking research\, and stories from curre
 nt students about what it is like to live\, study\, and build at MIT. MIT 
 Tour Guides Tour guides are current MIT undergraduate students\, graduate 
 students\, and MIT alumni.\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://ww
 w.meetboston.com/event/tour-of-mit/91252/
