BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Introduction to Watercolor & Pen
DTSTART:20260909T000000
DTEND:20271013T000000
DTSTAMP:20261027T170709Z
UID:ba561356337c2051dec20355c697b1@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:This six-week\, project-based class is designed for students w
 ho have had an introduction to the basics of watercolor and are looking to
  continue their practice. Projects will include a floral still life\, anim
 al portrait\, recipe illustration and lobster shack landscape. Each projec
 t will include guidance for color matching\, a step by step walkthrough fo
