DTEND:20261202T000000
DTSTAMP:20261027T170709Z
UID:602bb1b1a67e88066611548fcee69b@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Go behind the scenes at The Hanover Theatre and learn about it
 s unique history and design. Historic and Architectural Tour of The Hanove
 r Theatre. Experienced volunteer guides provide an in-depth look at the hi
 story and architecture of The Hanover Theatre on a two hour walking tour. 
 A magnificent example of early 20th century theatre architecture\, The Han
 over Theatre was designed by Thomas Lamb\, the foremost theatre and cinema
  architect of his day.\n\nSources: Discover Central Massachusetts\nEvent p
 age: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/historic-%26-architectural-to
 ur/30323/
