 wo afternoon tea cocktails are also available for $16 each. The Velvet Pet
 al combines Gunpowder Fig gin\, lemon\, lime\, basil and hibiscus foam. Th
 e Countess features New Amsterdam vodka\, passion fruit\, Earl Grey tea an
 d lemon. Set inside Carrie Nation’s Prohibition-inspired space near the 
