SUMMARY:Ghost Tours
DTSTART:20261022T000000
DTEND:20261031T000000
DTSTAMP:20261027T170709Z
UID:b22a5c51b6e8080174730c72ca16e0@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Cruise with us as we elaborate on the eerie sightings\, twiste
 d deaths\, and haunted landmarks along the banks of the Charles River. Hea
 r stories of Harry Houdini\, death by fire\, and a horrific murder at Harv
 ard University\, all from the safety of the boat. With an onboard bar feat
 uring themed cocktails\, even the worst skeptic will enjoy the sunset back
 drop\, beautiful city views and well-crafted tales. Cruise is in partnersh
 ip with Boston History Company who will provide a costumed tour guide for 
 every cruise. This tour is not recommended for children under the age of 1
 6. Please note that this is not a haunted house or haunted ship. This is a
  narrated tour along the river with some historical and fictional haunted 
 stories. Meeting Location Cruises depart from CambridgeSide Mall located a
 t 100 CambridgeSide Place Cambridge\, MA 02141. The boat and ticket booth 
 are located outside the doors of the CanalSide Food Hall at the CambridgeS
 ide Mall. Validated parking is available for $4.00 at the CambridgeSide Ma
 ll Garage Directions Cancellations All tickets are non-refundable and crui
 ses sail rain or shine. There is heat on board the boat for chilly evening
 s! Availability Cruise Schedule: Time: 5:30 - 7:00 pm (Boarding at 5:15 pm
 ) Additional tour from 7:30 - 9 pm October 24 Dates: October: 22\, 23\, 24
 \, 29\, 30 & 31 Ticket Prices: Ticket price does not include 5% MA Surchar
 ge or 6% Farehabor Processing Fee. Adults: $41.00 Military/Student/Seniors
 : $37.00\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/e
 vent/ghost-tours/93259/
LOCATION:Charles River Boat Company\, 100 CambridgeSide Place\, Cambridge
 \, MA\, 02141
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/ghost-tours/93259/
END:VEVENT
