DESCRIPTION:Be part of an unforgettable musical celebration of the legenda
 ry Barry Manilow while supporting a vital cause. Billboard’s #1 Adult Co
 ntemporary Artist of all time\, Barry Manilow has created some of the most
  beloved songs in popular music. This year’s tribute carries special sig
 nificance following his recent lung cancer diagnosis and successful early 
 detection\, underscoring the importance of awareness and timely diagnosis.
  This is the 18th annual benefit concert presented by Upstage Lung Cancer
 \, an organization that harnesses the power of music and the performing ar
 ts to fund innovative lung cancer research. Join us for an inspiring eveni
 ng featuring the Follen Angels Jazz Band\, award-winning vocalists and dan
 cers\, and Emmy Award-winning Joyce Kulhawik as emcee. Special guests incl
 ude thoracic surgeon Dr. Francine Jacobson and lung cancer survivor and pa
 tient advocate Lauren Coye. The evening will also feature presentation of 
 our annual Fan Award\, honoring contributions that have made a meaningful 
 impact on the lung cancer community. Lung cancer survivors can attend for 
 free using promo code SURVIVOR. LEARN MORE / GET TICKETS\n\nSources: Meet 
 Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/barry-manilow/93926/
LOCATION:Mosesian Center for the Arts\, The Mosesian Center for the Arts 3
 21 Arsenal St\, Watertown\, MA\, 02472
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/barry-manilow/93926/
