DTSTART:20261027T000000
DTEND:20261027T000000
DTSTAMP:20261027T170709Z
UID:bee844b2355ae26ec4c9e51656fc79@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:When the sun goes down\, the Museum feels like another world. 
 Explore the shadowed halls and candlelit Courtyard\, where ancient Roman s
 arcophagi stand among 15th-century French storefronts and centuries-old st
 onework. Search for hidden ravens\, wander through rooms filled with medie
 val and Renaissance treasures\, and let the flickering candlelight transfo
 rm the Museum into the perfect setting for Halloween. Come in costume. Bri
 ng your camera. And prepare to see the Museum in a whole new light. Or per
 haps\, in this case\, a whole new darkness. Guests should plan at least 60
  minutes to explore the grounds and galleries of this historic museum. Thi
 s event is expected to sell out. We strongly encourage carpooling with fri
 ends or using a ride-share service. At nearly a century\, the museum and c
 astle grounds are not handicapped accessible. This program is not intended
  for those under 13 years of age. We recommend arriving 10 minutes early t
 o allow enough time for the walk from the parking lot down to the museum\,
  then for the check-in process. Unfortunately\, we are unable to accommoda
 te late arrivals. If you miss the start of your timed session\, you will n
 ot be admitted at another time. Please note: all ticket sales are final\, 
 refunds are not offered\, and exchanges for other tour times are not permi
 tted. Heavy traffic should be considered when planning your travel time. H
 ammond Castle Museum member discounts apply! All proceeds from this progra
 m will support the restoration and preservation of the museum. - Timed ent
 rances every 15 minutes - 6-9 pm - Advanced reservations strongly encourag
 ed. Learn More/Get Tickets\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://ww
 w.meetboston.com/event/costumes-%26-candlelight%3a-hammond-castle-museum-a
 fter-dark/93382/
LOCATION:Hammond Castle Museum\, 80 Hesperus Avenue\, Gloucester\, MA\, 01
 930
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/costumes-%26-candlelight%3a-hammond-c
 astle-museum-after-dark/93382/
END:VEVENT
