BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Rockport Murder Mysteries
DTSTART:20261027T183000
DTEND:20261027T200000
DTSTAMP:20261027T170709Z
UID:0200109b36806b8af55f5c3ae5396e@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Join 1623 Studios for the premiere of the newest installment o
 f its award-winning Timeline: Cape Ann documentary series\, The Rockport M
 urder Mysteries. Based on the book Murder in Rockport\, Massachusetts: Ter
 ror in a Small Town by Robert Fitzgibbon and Wayne Soini\, the film explor
 es one of Cape Ann’s most haunting unsolved crimes. On May 21\, 1932\, R
 ockport tailor Arthur Oker was brutally murdered in his shop\, shocking th
 e quiet seaside community. Little more than a year later\, another Rockpor
 t resident\, Augusta Johnson\, was murdered in her home. The two crimes sp
 arked an extensive investigation that included searches throughout the tow
 n\, thousands of interviews\, and countless leads. Yet despite the extraor
 dinary effort to find answers\, both murders remain unsolved more than 90 
 years later. Produced by 1623 Studios\, The Rockport Murder Mysteries brin
 gs this fascinating chapter of local history to life through archival phot
 ographs and extensive historical research\, revisiting the crimes that sho
 ok the Rockport community more than 90 years ago. Following the screening
 \, stay for a conversation with 1623 Studios producer Kory Curcuru and aut
 hors Robert Fitzgibbon and Wayne Soini\, as they discuss the history behin
 d the murders\, the research that informed the book and documentary\, and 
 the process of bringing this remarkable local story to the screen. Proceed
 s from ticket sales will benefit 1623 Studios and help support its mission
  to provide community media\, local programming\, and opportunities for pe
 ople across Cape Ann to share their stories. Program Length: Approximately
  85 minutes\, followed by a post-screening discussion. There will be no in
 termission.\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page: https://northofboston
 .org/event/the-rockport-murder-mysteries/
LOCATION:Shalin Liu Performance Center\, 37 Main Street\, Rockport\, MA\, 
 01966
URL:https://northofboston.org/event/the-rockport-murder-mysteries/
END:VEVENT
