BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Amelia Park\, Imagination Awakened
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261029
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261030
DTSTAMP:20261027T170709Z
UID:9af2f3db998408d3f72eb186532bc8@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:**There’s a magical moment just before darkness falls…** W
 hen the last golden rays of sunlight begin to disappear beyond the trees\,
  the sky turns to shades of violet and blue\, and something extraordinary 
 begins to happen… The familiar slowly becomes unfamiliar. The shadows st
 retch a little farther. The lights begin to shimmer. Wisps of fog dance al
 ong the pathways\, and what was once a quiet garden begins to awaken. **An
 d suddenly… you’re not just walking through a garden anymore.** You’
 re stepping into a world where imagination has no boundaries. Across **1.3
  acres of winding pathways and wonderfully different themed worlds**\, you
 ’ll discover towering figures\, mysterious creatures\, whimsical surpris
 es\, and extraordinary sights waiting around every corner. Some will make 
 you smile. Others will leave you wide-eyed. And a few might just make you 
 stop in your tracks\, look up\, and whisper… **”WOW.”** Around every
  bend\, another opportunity to capture a little magic. A photograph beside
  something larger than life. A child gazing upward in amazement. A family 
 laughing together beneath the glow of the lights. **Because sometimes\, th
 e most magical part of an experience isn’t what we create… it’s the 
 wonder we see reflected in the faces of those experiencing it.** This isn
 ’t about jump scares or frightening anyone. It’s about atmosphere\, di
 scovery\, creativity\, and the beautiful feeling of letting your imaginati
 on run free. For the young\, the young at heart\, and anyone who still bel
 ieves that a little magic can exist in the world… **The garden is waitin
 g for you.** **YOUR INVITATION TO WONDER** Imagination Awakened — A Wick
 edly Wonderful Westfield Experience Presented by Imagination Preservation 
 Society and Holiday Preservation Society Amelia Park Memorial Garden\, 21 
 South Broad Street\, Westfield\, MA Sensory Thursdays: Oct 15\, 22\, 29 | 
 5–9 PM. Illuminated\, stationary and silent animatronics\; lighting\, fo
 g\, bubbles and photo opportunities remain. Quieter\, not sensory-free. Fu
 ll experience: Fridays Oct 16\, 23\, 30 | 5–9 PM\; Saturdays Oct 17\, 24
 \, 31 and Sundays Oct 18\, 25 | noon–9 PM. Sound and movement active\; n
 o jump scares. Last admission 9 PM\; gates close 10 PM. Admission: Adults 
 $20\, seniors $15\, ages 4–18 $10\, ages 3 and under FREE\; ticketing fe
 es may apply. General admission tickets valid once on any scheduled date. 
 Advance tickets (help shorten gate lines) General admission tickets are va
 lid for one visit on any scheduled event day. Purchasing ahead helps keep 
 the lines shorter and the magic flowing!\n\nSources: Explore Western Mass
 \nEvent page: https://explorewesternmass.com/event/amelia-park-imagination
 -awakened/2026-10-29/
URL:https://explorewesternmass.com/event/amelia-park-imagination-awakened/
 2026-10-29/
END:VEVENT
