DESCRIPTION:Nefarious New England with Sarah Hodge-Wetherbe From Betty and
  Barney Hill’s 1961 reported alien abduction to vampires in Rhode Island
 \, a wealth of spooky tales are known all over the Northeast. In this pres
 entation\, we look at some of the most famous cases from each state and te
 ll the tales that have entertained generations of New Englanders. Decide f
 or yourself if you ought to sleep with the lights on!\n\nSources: Explore 
