BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:MGM Springfield\, Roar! Comedy Club
DTSTART:20261030T200000
DTEND:20261030T220000
DTSTAMP:20261027T170709Z
UID:5b89b11b041eefd57ed70794453d3f@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Jeff Allen Friday October 30\, 2026 – 8:00 PM Jeff Allen may
  (or may not) want to admit it\, but he’s getting old. At 69\, Jeff is s
 taring down his 70th year and decided it might be time to think about slow
 ing down. The result? My First Final Farewell Tour kicks off March 1\, 202
 6. Yes\, you read that right—“First” and “Final” in the same sen
 tence—because Jeff’s not totally sure he’s done. (After all\, Cher h
 ad 20 farewell tours\, and Elton John is still out there.) What he is sure
  of: he’s bringing a mix of fan favorites and fresh new material to the 
 stage. From the classic Happy Wife\, Happy Life routine you’ve been quot
 ing for years\, to fresh takes on marriage\, family\, and everyday life\, 
 Jeff is pulling it all together for a night that’s hilarious\, unforgett
 able\, and uplifting. Jeff Allen is one of America’s most beloved comedi
 ans\, with nearly 1 billion online views and a record-setting seven Dry Ba
 r Comedy specials. He’s been featured on America’s Got Talent\, The To
 day Show\, Comedy Central\, Showtime\, and starred in the films Apostles o
 f Comedy and My 7 Grandmas. Millions have seen him across Facebook\, Insta
 gram\, TikTok\, and YouTube—but nothing compares to seeing Jeff live. Up
 grade your night out with General Admission Table seating. Enjoy convenien
 t table service with a dedicated server for food and beverages—no lines
 \, no interruptions\, just great comedy and great service. Select General 
 Admission Table Seating at checkout. BUY TICKETS MGM Springfield is the pl
 ace to go for laughs. The unique comedy series developed by John Tobin Pre
 sents\, features an eclectic mix of nationally popular comedians as well a
 s rising industry stars. Upcoming Performances\n\nSources: Explore Western
  Mass\nEvent page: https://explorewesternmass.com/event/mgm-springfield-ro
 ar-comedy-club-2/
LOCATION:MGM Springfield\, One MGM Way\, Springfield\, MA\, 01103
URL:https://explorewesternmass.com/event/mgm-springfield-roar-comedy-club-
 2/
END:VEVENT
