BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Murder Mystery Dinner | I Love the 80's to DEATH - new date
DTSTART:20261030T000000
DTEND:20261030T000000
DTSTAMP:20261027T170709Z
UID:707e03853465f3a9a5e5ad86b65f0b@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:The 80’s are taking over The Barn at Wight Farm this Hallowe
 en and the biggest names in music are in town for one unforgettable concer
 t event. But when backstage drama turns deadly\, the spotlight shifts from
  center stage to a full blown murder mystery. This is not Miami Vice… th
 is is murder\, and you are part of the investigation. Break out the neon\,
  tease that hair sky high\, grab your leg warmers\, and channel your inner
  rockstar detective. From Careless Whispers to Sunglasses at Night\, you w
 ill follow the clues\, uncover secrets\, and work to solve the crime in to
 tally rad 80’s style. As the mystery unfolds\, enjoy a plated dinner pre
 pared by the chefs at The Barn. Dinner Menu (plated dinner): Cheese & Arti
 san Crackers Cocktail Hour 1st Course: Bistro Garden Salad 2nd Course: Bee
 f Tenderloin Medallions - Creamy Mashed Potatoes\, Asparagus Dessert: Chee
 secake with Fresh Strawberries (Vegetarian option: Burrata Ravioli) Kindly
  inform us at the time of booking if you prefer a vegetarian selection. Da
 te: Friday October 30\, 2026 Time: Arrive at 5:45 PM | Mystery begins at 6
  PM Location: The Barn at Wight Farm Cost: $75 per guest (tax and gratuity
  not included) A $30 deposit per person is required at booking and will be
  applied to your final bill. Full cash bar available. Get ready for a nigh
 t of HALLOWEEN FUN - food\, fun\, nostalgia\, and intrigue you will not wa
 nt to miss. If you need assistance\, please call us at 774.241.8450.\n\nSo
 urces: Discover Central Massachusetts\nEvent page: https://www.discovercen
 tralma.org/event/murder-mystery-dinner-%7c-i-love-the-80s-to-death-new-dat
 e/29850/
LOCATION:The Barn at Wight Farm\, 420 Main St.\, Sturbridge\, MA\, 01566
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/murder-mystery-dinner-%7c-i-lo
 ve-the-80s-to-death-new-date/29850/
