BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Mill District General Store\, Workshop
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261030
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261031
DTSTAMP:20261027T170709Z
UID:eed37ab83050f677d6f2b0ae38984f@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Join Julie Root Sawyer to discover the magic of alcohol inks a
 nd delaminating inks in this Friday morning series. Create vibrant\, expre
 ssive landscapes inspired by nature in a setting where exploration and cre
 ative risk-taking are encouraged. Play\, learn\, and reconnect with the jo
 y of creating! Each workshop is a stand-alone experience – attend one or
  join the entire series! See link for more specific class details. Discove
 r the magic of alcohol inks and delaminating inks as you create vibrant\, 
 expressive landscapes inspired by nature. Through guided demonstrations an
 d playful experimentation\, you’ll explore color\, movement\, and the be
 autiful unpredictability of these exciting mediums. No experience is neces
 sary—just curiosity and a willingness to explore. You’ll leave with a 
 finished artwork\, new techniques\, and the confidence to continue creatin
 g. NOTE: Alcohol ink can stain clothes. Attendees may want to bring an apr
 on. Julie will provide gloves. S ept 18: Alcohol Ink Landscapes: exploring
  movement\, color\, & unpredictability Sept 25: Alcohol Ink Flowers: explo
 ring saturated colors\, form\, & pattern ** Oct 2: NO CLASS** Oct. 9: Abst
 ract Watercolor Landscapes: exploring mark-making & movement Oct. 16: Dela
 minating Inks: exploring the textural qualities of delaminating inks Oct 2
 3: Delaminating In Seascapes: exploring ocean-inspired abstract compositio
 ns Oct. 30: Delaminating Ink Simple Landscapes: exploring delaminting inks
  on canvas Workshops run from 10:30-12pm. $50 per class\, includes all mat
 erials. Preregistration required . $50 per class\, including material. OR 
 6 classes for $250\, 3 classes for $130.\n\nSources: Explore Western Mass
 \nEvent page: https://explorewesternmass.com/event/the-mill-district-gener
 al-store-workshop/2026-10-30/
LOCATION:The Mill District\, 91 Cowls Road\, Amherst\, MA\, 01002
URL:https://explorewesternmass.com/event/the-mill-district-general-store-w
 orkshop/2026-10-30/
END:VEVENT
