DESCRIPTION:An Evening of Spooky Fun with the Spirit Sisters at Wistariahu
 rst! As All Hallows’ Eve approaches and the nights grow darker\, peer be
 hind the veil and explore the eerie depths of Wistariahurst Museum with th
 e Spirit Sisters. Join us for a spine-chilling night of ghostly adventures
  where you will dive into a paranormal investigation inside our halls. Lea
 rn about essential ghost-hunting equipment and\, perhaps\, even hear whisp
 ers from those who linger in the shadows of the museum. This event is your
  perfect chance to embrace the haunting atmosphere and uncover the secrets
  hidden within our historic walls. This exclusive guided tour of Wistariah
 urst Museum includes standing\, walking\, and transitioning between the fi
 rst and second floors using our Grand Staircase in dim lighting. If you ar
 e interested in our Spirits Speak paranormal investigation and have any qu
 estions about accessibility\, please reach out to us at info@wistariahurst
 .org. Tickets for this chilling experience are known to vanish quickly\, s
 o secure yours today to ensure your place in this ghostly escapade. By pur
 chasing this ticket\, you will be entered to win a private paranormal inve
 stigation of Wistariahurst Museum with the Spirit Sisters. Don’t let thi
 s spectral opportunity slip away! Prepare for an unforgettable night among
 st our happy haunts! $15 – $18 Get tickets For tickets and more informat
 ion\, click here SOLD OUT!\n\nSources: Explore Western Mass\nEvent page: h
 ttps://explorewesternmass.com/event/wistariahurst-museum-spirits-speak/
