DESCRIPTION:For 35 years now\, the Scream Team of Fear on the Farm has bee
 n bringing new horror and excitement to the farm every October. Our intera
 ctive midway offers something to entertain you while you wait to enter the
  attractions- photo ops\, concessions and entertainment. The Monster Mash 
 Haunted Hayride rolls out to the fields every Friday through Sunday in Oct
 ober from 7pm until the last rider runs screaming. After the Hayride\, if 
 you are still brave enough\, more ghouls\, zombies and other creatures awa
 it you in the Massacre Manor and DON Haunted Walkthroughs. Fear on the Far
 m at McCray’s Farm is the tradition for Halloween in Western Mass There 
 is inherit risk in attending Fear on the Farm at McCray’s Farm. Actors d
 o jump out to startle and scare you. Attendees voluntarily assume all risk
 s associated with attending Fear on the Farm at McCray’s Farm. Do not to
 uch us and we WILL NOT touch you. Please dress accordingly. BUY TICKETS ON
 LINE OR ON SITE DURING OUR NIGHTS OF OPERATION\, STARTING AT 6:30PM MONSTE
 R MASH HAUNTED HAYRIDE\, MASSACRE MANOR & THE D.O.N.G.R.F $30.00 General A
 dmission $50.00 Fast Pass (skip to the front of the line)\, available onli
 ne ONLY We are open every Friday\, Saturday and Sunday in October\, 2026. 
 The ticket box office opens at 6:30 pm\, the Monster Mash Haunted Hayride
 \, Massacre Manor and The D.O.N.G.R.F open at 7:00 pm\, and the terror con
 tinues until the last rider runs out screaming! For the most up-to-date we
 ather related information\, such as cancellations\, please visit our Faceb
 ook page @fearonthefarmatmccraysfarm ! That page is updated daily!\n\nSour
 ces: Explore Western Mass\nEvent page: https://explorewesternmass.com/even
 t/mccrays-farm-fear-on-the-farm/2026-10-31/
LOCATION:McCray’s Farm\, 55 Alvord St\, South Hadley\, MA\, 01075
URL:https://explorewesternmass.com/event/mccrays-farm-fear-on-the-farm/202
 6-10-31/
END:VEVENT
