UID:f2058d8e68b6a2bb1db0f2b59ea099@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Every year\, something unexpected happens behind these histori
 c walls. This Halloween\, The Liberty steps into the space between virtue 
 and vice. On Saturday\, October 31st\, Sinners & Saints takes over The Lib
 erty for a night of mystery\, temptation\, and after-dark indulgence. With
  two DJs taking over the Lobby and Ballroom\, themed cocktails\, immersive
  photo moments\, and dancing well into the night\, it’s a Halloween part
 y unlike any other. Expect a moody\, sexy ambiance. Touches of the divine.
  Hints of the forbidden. And just enough left unseen. __ ADMISSION Early B
 ird General Admission (LIVE) | Limited Quantity\, Limited Time Early Acces
 s Tickets are available now. Your ticket grants access to Boston’s large
 st Halloween party\, Sinners & Saints\, across the Lobby and Ballroom. VIP
  TABLES Lobby Table | $1\,300 + fees At the heart of the celebration\, wit
 h a front-row view of the energy unfolding throughout the Lobby. Includes 
 table for up to 10 guests\, bites throughout the evening\, VIP access to a
 ll event areas\, and one bottle of Don Julio Reposado. CATWALK Table | Sta
 rting at $520 + fees An intimate vantage point above the main floor\, offe
 ring a balance of privacy and atmosphere while overlooking the Lobby. Incl
 udes table for 4–8 guests\, bites throughout the evening\, VIP access to
  all event areas\, and one bottle of Don Julio Reposado. Ballroom Table | 
 $1\,300 + fees For those who want to stay close to the rhythm of the night
 \, with direct access to one of the evening’s main entertainment spaces.
  Includes table for up to 10 guests\, bites throughout the evening\, VIP a
 ccess to all event areas\, and one bottle of Don Julio Reposado. And there
 ’s more temptation to come. Halloween Dinner at CLINK. and Overnight Roo
 m Packages will be unveiled soon. Come dressed for whichever side of you w
 ins after dark. Sinners & Saints. Halloween at The Liberty.\n\nSources: Me
 et Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/sinners-%26-saints
 -halloween-party/92530/
LOCATION:The Liberty Hotel Boston\, 215 Charles Street 215 Charles St\, Bo
 ston\, MA\, 02114
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/sinners-%26-saints-halloween-party/92
 530/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Six Flags New England\, Fright Fest
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261031
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261101
DTSTAMP:20261027T170709Z
UID:31b994009f3c4aa10034e816c7e877@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for the best Halloween event of the season! Horrors 
 lurk in foggy corners\, and haunts await your presence. Brave the night fo
 r Fright Fest presented by SNICKERS® and encounter spine-tingling chills 
 in our ambient Scare Zones\, or unwind by watching one of our scary-good l
 ive shows. Plus\, true horror fans can unlock new fears with our exclusive
 \, pay-to-panic Haunted Mazes!* And don’t forget — a trip to Six Flags
  New England wouldn’t be complete without a ride or three on Wicked Cycl
 one. It’s even scarier after dark! Fright Fest features more than 20 att
 ractions\, including five haunted mazes: Nightmares\, Terror Tales\, Slash
 er Circus 3D\, Midnight Mansion\, and Camp Killamore. Guests will also enc
 ounter seven immersive scare zones located throughout the park\, where cre
 atures lurk in the fog and sinister performers emerge from the shadows. Ea
 ch zone delivers its own brand of fear\, from a toxic wasteland to a city 
 overrun by demons\, and even a carnival of sinister clowns. Guests can als
 o experience frightfully fun entertainment with live shows including Midni
 ght Uprising\, The Awakening\, and Mort’s Used Coffins. Back for its sec
 ond season\, Love at First Fright is a family-friendly musical\, where soc
 ial media influencers’ quest for viral content takes a playful twist whe
 n monsters get involved. Gather your friends and prepare for fright: the p
 ark of your dreams becomes a nightmare this Halloween at Six Flags New Eng
 land. Haunted Mazes Are you brave enough to step inside? The only way out 
 is through! Experience them all with the Haunted Maze Pass Scare Zones Wat
 ch your back! There could be a zombie\, a witch\, or another terrifying gh
 oul lurking in the dark. Rides in the Dark When the sun goes down the scar
 e factor turns up. Experience chilling rides and coasters in darkness. Pre
 pared to be SCARED…if you DARE… A warning for the wary — Fright Fest
  presented by SNICKERS® is an intensely scary Halloween event and is not 
 recommended for children younger than 13. For family-friendly fun this fal
 l\, try Six Flags New England’s other seasonal events\, Kids Boo Fest an
 d Oktoberfest! Park admission includes both Kids Boo Fest and Fright Fest 
 and tickets are available online . For more information on fall events\, t
 ickets or the park’s code of conduct\, visit sixflags.com/newengland. Pa
 rk admission to Fright Fest is included with your Season Pass or Membershi
 p. Six Flags New England is committed to maintaining a place where familie
 s and friends can come together to enjoy a one-of-a-kind park full of fun 
 experiences and immersive entertainment. After 6:00 p.m. Fright Fest is no
 t recommended for children 12 and under. Beginning at 4:00 p.m. all guests
  aged 17 years old or younger must be accompanied by a chaperone who is at
  least 21 years old to be admitted to or remain in the park.\n\nSources: E
 xplore Western Mass\nEvent page: https://explorewesternmass.com/event/six-
 flags-new-england-fright-fest-2/2026-10-31/
LOCATION:Six Flags New England\, 1623 Main Street\, Agawam\, MA\, 01001
URL:https://explorewesternmass.com/event/six-flags-new-england-fright-fest
 -2/2026-10-31/
END:VEVENT
