BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sunderland\, Mike’s Maze at Warner Farm
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261031
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261101
DTSTAMP:20261027T170709Z
UID:5cfaa7d9ea9fab152529855cf0cb72@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:CLICK The static meets the stalks at Mike’s Maze as we celeb
 rate 100 years of television. In 1926\, Scottish inventor John Logie Baird
  transmitted the world’s first live television image marking a new era o
 f at-home entertainment. Now we’re bringing a century of TV history and 
 culture to our cornfield in Sunderland\, Massachusetts and this is one sea
 son you won’t want to miss. Tune in this fall for 8 acres of must-see co
 rn! Experience the Greatest Corn on Earth this fall at Mike’s Maze! Acti
 vities : Mike’s Magnificent playground Shoot out the Giant Slide Send sp
 uds soaring at the Potato Cannons Launch into flight on the Jump Pad Spin 
 yourself into a trance on the Rolling Tubes Ride and race the pedal carts 
 on Dave’s Daredevil Derby Marvel at Mike’s Menagerie—these animals m
 ight not be exotic\, but you can pet them Enjoy all your fairground favori
 tes served fresh at the Corn Cafe\, featuring everything from kettle corn 
 and cider donuts to burgers and farm fries Make Mike’s Maze at Warner Fa
 rm a part of your New England autumn tradition! Each fall\, we unveil a ne
 w incredible design and themed experience. Our mazes have made headlines a
 nd attracted global attention for nearly 20 years. Mike’s Maze is at 23 
 South Main Street in Sunderland\, Massachusetts—just a short distance fr
 om Interstate 91\, exit 24. Open Fridays\, Saturdays\, Sundays – Septemb
 er 11 – November 8 2026 Fridays: 11am – 5pm (wagon rides & face painti
 ng are not available on Friday) Saturdays\, Sundays\, & Columbus Day: 9am 
 – 5pm All visitors pay a general admission rate to enter the farm ground
 s. General admission at Mike’s Maze gives you access to our 8-acre maze 
 experience and an epic playground for kids of all ages. Also included is o
 ur Camera Obscura\, Petting Zoo\, and more! Make your visit a full day eve
 nt by adding on some of the and enjoying eats and treats at the optional A
 ttractions and our Corn Cafe! Tickets may be purchased online OR in person
 . You DO NOT need to reserve tickets before arriving! Beer Mazes tickets f
 or 2026! Join us this year for an evening of maze-crawling and beer tastin
 g at Mike’s Maze at Warner Farm! As dusk falls\, grab a flashlight and h
 ead into the maze to play games and track down local brews at tasting stat
 ions hidden inside the maze. We are excited to be back with a whole new ma
 ze field and special-themed trivia just for those 21 and older! We are hos
 ting 5 separate beer mazes this year\, one each Friday night in October. W
 hen purchasing your tickets \, be sure you are selecting the correct date 
 for the event you want to attend .\n\nSources: Explore Western Mass\nEvent
  page: https://explorewesternmass.com/event/sunderland-mikes-maze-at-warne
 r-farm/2026-10-31/
LOCATION:Warner Farm\, 23 S. Main Street\, Sunderland\, MA\, 01375
URL:https://explorewesternmass.com/event/sunderland-mikes-maze-at-warner-f
 arm/2026-10-31/
END:VEVENT
