BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Woods Hole Film Festival Dinner & A Movie: Mallory's Ghost
DTSTART:20261031T000000
DTEND:20261031T000000
DTSTAMP:20261027T170709Z
UID:a23403f7e817282f4076097dd1be85@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Mallory's Ghost A young woman accompanies her playwright boyfr
 iend to a coastal Maine retreat\, only to become obsessed with his glamoro
 us ex\, whose presence seems to haunt her. As she’s drawn into a surreal
  journey through time\, Mallory must confront her own insecurities in this
  psychological exploration of envy and self-discovery. Arabella Oz stars i
 n\, writes\, and directs her feature debut which premiered at SXSW. Buy Ti
 ckets HERE. DINNER & A MOVIE is a film series presented by Woods Hole Film
  Festival as part of its year-round independent film program\, featuring t
 wice-monthly screenings of independent films from early fall to late sprin
 g. The Dinner and a Movie series includes films from the Woods Hole Film F
 estival\, as well as independent films curated specifically for the series
 . ABOUT THE SCREENINGS: Dinner and a Movie screenings are held at the Wood
 s Hole Oceanographic Institution’s Redfield Auditorium. Screenings typic
 ally begin at 7:00 pm\, with doors opening for seating thirty minutes prio
 r. Redfield Auditorium is located at 45 Water Street in Woods Hole. The fa
 cility is wheelchair accessible. Hearing assistance devices are available 
 at the venue\, upon request. Street parking is available in Woods Hole. Fr
 ee parking is available in certain lots operated by the Woods Hole Oceanog
 raphic Institution after 5 pm. ABOUT THE DINNER: Ticketholders receive a d
 iscount at the Captain Kidd Restaurant & Quahog Republic Leeside Pub. Rese
 rvations are encouraged. The Captain Kidd Restaurant at 77 Water Street of
 fers Dinner and a Movie ticket holders a 10% discount on the meal portion 
 (excluding any alcohol) of their bill. For reservations for parties up to 
 eight people\, please complete the online reservation form and in the “s
 pecial request” field\, please indicate Dinner and a Movie. This will he
 lp the staff accommodate the timing for the screening start. For parties o
 f nine or more\, please call 508-548-8563. Please note: The Captain Kidd r
 estaurant is closed seasonally from late December\, 2026 until late April
 \, 2027. Please contact the participating restaurant for reservations or i
 nformation. Ticket purchasers are asked to notify the restaurant that they
  are attending the Dinner and A Movie screening upon seating\, and present
  their e-tickets for the discount or special offers.\n\nSources: Cape Cod 
 Chamber\nEvent page: https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/woods-hole-film-
 festival-dinner-%26-a-movie%3a-mallorys-ghost/52432/
LOCATION:Woods Hole Oceanographic Institution\, Redfield Auditorium at WHO
 I 45 Water Street\, Woods Hole\, MA\, 02563
URL:https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/woods-hole-film-festival-dinner-%
 26-a-movie%3a-mallorys-ghost/52432/
END:VEVENT
