BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Berkshire East\, Fall Outdoor Adventures
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261101
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261102
DTSTAMP:20261027T170709Z
UID:1e45edab935dcbb91a28eba934183f@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Ready for an adventure? Experience these Berkshire East unforg
 ettable fall outdoor adventures including….. Thunderbolt Mountain Coaste
 r: Think of it as a combination alpine slide and roller coaster. The Thund
 erbolt takes riders up 1\,580 feet of up-track through the forest before t
 he cart disengages and gravity takes over. Coast through the foliage rides
  start for just $10/person per ride! Fall Hours – from September 5th thr
 ough November 8th Saturdays and Sundays – 11am to 5pm Monday\, October 1
 2th – Indigenous Peoples’ Day – 11am to 5pm Adventure Park : The Aer
 ial Adventure Park is a unique and exciting suspended challenge course fea
 turing a unique blend of elevated wooden platforms and exciting elements. 
 A series of self-guided challenges in the trees with two courses to choose
  from. Each course is designed with platforms suspended from a gorgeous pi
 ne grove connected by Indiana Jones bridges\, Tarzan swings\, rolling zip 
 lines\, TrueBlue free falls\, and other challenging obstacles to navigate.
  Its great for all ages and especially good for youth who love Ninja Warri
 or! Traverse through the foliage on our challenge course in the trees for 
 just $33! Late Fall Hours – from October 3rd through November 1st Saturd
 ays and Sundays – 12pm to 4:30pm Monday\, October 12th – Indigenous Pe
 oples’ Day – 12pm to 4:30pm Thunder Mountain Bike Park: Berkshire East
  Mountain Resort is home to Thunder Mountain Bike Park\, a progression bik
 e park built by Gravity Logic\, builders of some of the most-ridden DH tra
 ils on the planet. Thunder Mountain Bike Park is open Fridays\, Saturdays
 \, Sundays\, and Mondays. Lift tickets start at just $47 ! Scenic Chairlif
 t Ride Take in sweeping Fall views of Charlemont for just $10.60 . Ride up
  to the summit and back down. Book Now\n\nSources: Explore Western Mass\nE
 vent page: https://explorewesternmass.com/event/berkshire-east-fall-outdoo
 r-adventures/2026-11-01/
LOCATION:Berkshire East Mountain Resort\, 66 Thunder Mountain Road\, Charl
 emont\, MA\, 01339
URL:https://explorewesternmass.com/event/berkshire-east-fall-outdoor-adven
 tures/2026-11-01/
END:VEVENT
