BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Mill District General Store\, Society of Sketch
DTSTART:20261104T180000
DTEND:20261104T200000
DTSTAMP:20261027T170709Z
UID:ab8febe7423f2cf7095f883b335a6c@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Society of Sketch is an 18+ community drawing night that blend
 s fast-paced sketching with wildly dressed models and a whole lot of creat
 ive freedom. Each session features multiple models \, a 60-second warm-up 
 \, and rotating 3–5 minute poses \, with fun challenges thrown in for bo
 th the artists and the models. It’s not a class—it’s a collaborative
 \, no-pressure space to connect with fellow creatives\, loosen up your lin
 es\, and let loose your imagination. All skill levels welcome. Costumes ar
 e wild\, the vibe is weird\, and no two sessions are the same. First Wedne
 sday of every month. Free to attend. 2026 SCHEDULE 2/4 – DATE NIGHT: Bri
 ng a friend – draw each other! 3/4 – LONG POSE NIGHT: 10-20 Minute Pos
 es 4/1 – APRIL FOOLS: A Circus Theme 5/6 – CLOSE UP PORTRAITS 6/3 – 
 A FLORAL AFFAIR: Sketching with Flowers 7/1 – DAD BOD BBQ: We sketch out
 side the gallery! *Weather Permitting 8/5 – HEAVY METAL MAYHEM: Musical 
 Props! 9/2 – 80’S TIME WARP 10/7 – GHOSTLY GATHERING: Posing as ghos
 ts! 11/4 – LEAF PEEPER COUTURE 12/2 – ELVES ON SHELVES\n\nSources: Exp
 lore Western Mass\nEvent page: https://explorewesternmass.com/event/the-mi
 ll-district-general-store-society-of-sketch/2026-11-04/
LOCATION:The Mill District\, 91 Cowls Road\, Amherst\, MA\, 01002
URL:https://explorewesternmass.com/event/the-mill-district-general-store-s
 ociety-of-sketch/2026-11-04/
END:VEVENT
