DESCRIPTION:More than just yarn! Don’t miss The Fiber Festival of New En
 gland. Are “ewe” ready? Come see the annual Fiber Festival in the Mall
 ary Complex at Eastern States Exposition. There will be sheep shearing\, w
 orkshops\, fleece sale\, fiber animals\, demonstrations\, finished items f
 or sale\, and a fiber fashion show. It’s more than just yarn! Produced b
 y Eastern States Exposition and the New England Sheep and Wool Growers Ass
 ociation\, more than 200 booths and 22 workshops are being brought to fibe
 r fanatics! From an educational experience with crafter demonstrations and
  live animals\, to the perfect holiday shopping opportunity\, come on down
  to the Fiber Festival of New England! For more information\, tickets\, or
  to sign up for a workshop\, please click here . HOURS : Saturday – 9 am
  to 5 pm\; Sunday – 9 am to 3 pm. LOCATION : Mallary Complex The annual 
 event\, co-produced by the Eastern States Exposition and the New England S
 heep and Wool Growers Association\, aims to promote the use of wool and ot
 her natural fibers and related products to the general public. In addition
  to purchasing fleece\, all types of fiber\, supplies\, and equipment\, as
  well as kits to get started on a project\, there are plenty of “finishe
 d” items to buy.\n\nSources: Explore Western Mass\nEvent page: https://e
 xplorewesternmass.com/event/eastern-states-exposition-fiber-festival/
LOCATION:Eastern States Exposition\, 1305 Memorial Avenue\, West Springfie
 ld\, MA\, 01089
URL:https://explorewesternmass.com/event/eastern-states-exposition-fiber-f
 estival/
END:VEVENT
