DTEND:20261107T210000
DTSTAMP:20261027T170709Z
UID:06cc2a09095e08f0fde3105460c82f@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Renburke’s Rovers play live Irish music at the ICC on Saturd
 ay\, November 7 from 6–9 pm. If you would like dinner reservations\, ple
 ase call 413-342-4358. All are welcome to come and enjoy the music. Mark R
 enburke and Abe Myler bring their mix of Irish pub favorites and folk-rock
  classics to each performance. Their lively style and authentic vocal harm
 onies make for an entertaining evening of music.\n\nSources: Explore Weste
 rn Mass\nEvent page: https://explorewesternmass.com/event/irish-cultural-c
 enter-live-irish-music-6/
LOCATION:The Irish Cultural Center of Western New England\, 429 Morgan Roa
 d\, West Springfield\, MA\, 01089
