 ation bringing together local restaurants\, businesses\, and community mem
 bers for an unforgettable evening. Taste of Cape Cod is an annual fundrais
 er hosted by the Friends of Nobska Light that showcases the region’s bes
 t flavors while supporting the preservation of the historic Nobska Light. 
 Guests will enjoy tastes from local restaurants and caterers and have the 
 opportunity to bid on exciting auction items -- all while learning about a
 nd supporting the future of Nobska Light\, ensuring its legacy continues t
 o shine for generations to come. https://friendsofnobska.org/taste-of-cape
 -cod\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamber\nEvent page: https://www.capecodchamber.
 org/event/2nd-annual-taste-of-cape-cod/51876/
