DTEND:20261108T163000
DTSTAMP:20261027T170709Z
UID:017ebc89719ad172e7d824c96c7d00@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Dates: October 24\, 25\, 31\; November 1\, 7\, 8\, 14\, 15 Fam
 ily Program: Stories and Stones Have you ever walked through a graveyard a
 nd wondered about the gravestone designs and how they’ve lasted for hund
 reds of years? Visit the Discovery Center to learn more and draw or carve 
 a design into soap using icons from Deerfield’s Old Burying Ground as in
 spiration. See and touch examples of the stones that carvers used\, includ
 ing sandstone\, slate\, and granite\, and learn about Deerfield rocks goin
 g back millions of years!\n\nSources: Explore Western Mass\nEvent page: ht
