SUMMARY:UMass Fine Arts Center\, Sugar Skull! A Día de Muertos Musical Ad
 venture!
DTSTART:20261108T150000
DTEND:20261108T170000
DTSTAMP:20261027T170709Z
UID:579767bd73fccf4c4483d67db817b5@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Keep the family fun of spooky season going for an extra week w
 ith this special matinee event! Sugar Skull! A Día de Muertos Musical Adv
 enture is a bilingual/bicultural musical for young audiences and families 
 that uses traditional regional music and dance from Mexico to tell the sto
 ry of twelve-year-old Vita Flores. Vita thinks her family has gone loco pl
 anning a celebration for deceased loved ones. Why throw a party for the de
 ad? But when a spirited candy skeleton suddenly springs to life\, Vita fin
 ds herself on a magical\, musical journey to unravel the true meaning of D
 ía de Muertos. With her skeletal new friend\, Vita dances with ancient an
 cestors\, sings with a sorrowful sorceress\, escapes the trickster chanequ
 es \, and even meets the famous Catrina Calavera. But can this clever yout
 h gather the missing pieces needed for her family ofrenda before it’s to
 o late? Total price starts at: $35.00. Total price for youth 17 and under 
 and Five College students starts at: $20.00. TICKETS\n\nSources: Explore W
 estern Mass\nEvent page: https://explorewesternmass.com/event/umass-fine-a
 rts-center-sugar-skull-a-dia-de-muertos-musical-adventure/
LOCATION:UMass Amherst\, 300 Massachusetts Ave\, Amherst\, MA\, 01003
URL:https://explorewesternmass.com/event/umass-fine-arts-center-sugar-skul
 l-a-dia-de-muertos-musical-adventure/
