 erials provided. Sign-up here: Mahjong at Wequasset: Beginner Mahj and Ope
 n Play - The Mahjmont Society Advance registration is required. Please vis
 it the event registration page for pricing and details. Mahjong | Beginner
  Class and Open Play | Wequassett\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamber\nEvent page
 : https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/mahjong-beginner-class-%26-open-pla
 y-at-wequassett/52604/
LOCATION:twenty-eight atlantic\, at the Wequassett Resort and Golf Club\, 
 2173 Route 28\, Harwich\, MA\, 02645
