DESCRIPTION:Krazy Kat and Calvin & Hobbes: Classic Comics Family Day Join 
 us for a day of family fun as we celebrate the opening of two special exhi
 bitions featuring Krazy Kat and Calvin & Hobbes . Join our team of educato
 rs and special guest artist\, Leonardo Quiles\, for comic strip-themed art
 making & more. All ages are welcome. Drop-in\, no reservations required. F
 ree with Museum admission* *Free Admission for Kids on Opening Weekend is 
 offered thanks to funding from the Art Bridges Cohort Program Leonardo Qui
 les is an author\, illustrator\, comics artist\, and elementary visual art
 s educator. He studied Illustration at Parsons School of Design and holds 
 an MFA in Illustration from the University of Hartford. His background in 
