DESCRIPTION:The Polish Holiday Festival takes place on Saturday\, November
  14\, 2026 \, at the Chicopee Public Library . Located at 449 Front Street
  in Chicopee\, Massachusetts \, the event highlights the region’s rich P
 olish-American heritage through traditional holiday celebrations\, communi
 ty gatherings\, and cultural displays. Free admission and open to the publ
 ic. The festival brings together community members to appreciate local his
 tory\, festive music\, and traditional crafts. For those interested in loc
 al history and regional heritage\, the library also maintains the Chicopee
  Public Library Photography Collection \, which documents decades of histo
 rical local Polish civic celebrations.\n\nSources: Explore Western Mass\nE
 vent page: https://explorewesternmass.com/event/polish-center-of-discovery
