SUMMARY:The Eric Carle Museum\, Yoga for Kids!
DTSTART:20261114T100000
DTEND:20261114T110000
DTSTAMP:20261027T170709Z
UID:387cb08b17424b231fcd1b8b4d858e@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Join us and certified children’s yoga instructor! Children w
 ill be invited to practice foundational yoga poses and breathing exercises
 \, while stretching and strengthening their bodies and minds. Class will b
 e geared towards ages 3–6\, but parents and siblings are welcome. Join u
 s and certified yoga instructor\, Ellen Morbyrne\, as we explore movement 
 and fun inspired by picture books! Children will be invited to practice fo
 undational yoga poses and breathing exercises. Class will be geared toward
 s ages 3–6\, but parents and siblings are welcome. Participants are enco
 uraged to attend Storytime following to stretch both their bodies and mind
 s. Once participants check in at the Front Desk\, they will meet Ellen in 
 the Auditorium. Guests are welcome to bring water or a yoga mat! The Carle
  will also have additional yoga mats to borrow. This program is a collabor
 ation between the Eric Carle Museum of Picture Book Art and Yoga Sanctuary
 . Who You’ll Meet Ellen Morbyrne Ellen found her home in yoga at thirtee
 n and has been a dedicated practitioner ever since. As someone with a life
 long chronic illness\, finding a physical and spiritual practice which unv
 eiled her intrinsic\, capable\, already-sufficient wholeness has inspired 
 Ellen to invite others to discover their own innate potential for meaningf
 ul self-expression. She began teaching yoga to teens and adults of all age
 s in 2009. After completing a 200-hour yoga teacher training at Yoga Sanct
 uary\, Ellen discovered a particular love for teaching prenatal yoga. Elle
 n brings her experience as a professional theatre artist\, a youth educato
 r\, and a mom of two awesome kids to her yoga teaching. All of Ellen’s c
 lasses are rich with practical philosophy\, down-to-earth humor\, playfuln
 ess\, and a passion for both alignment and the therapeutic applications of
  yoga practice.\n\nSources: Explore Western Mass\nEvent page: https://expl
 orewesternmass.com/event/the-eric-carle-museum-yoga-for-kids/
LOCATION:The Eric Carle Museum of Picture Book Art\, 125 W Bay Road\, Amhe
 rst\, MA\, 01002
URL:https://explorewesternmass.com/event/the-eric-carle-museum-yoga-for-ki
 ds/
END:VEVENT
