SUMMARY:Eastern States Exposition\, Thanksgiving Classic Cluster Dog Show
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261120
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261125
DTSTAMP:20261027T170709Z
UID:a8d5cdcdee67c432cd06e57c889d43@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:All breed dog shows and Obedience trials sponsored by Holyoke
 \, South Windsor\, Springfield & Windham County Kennel Clubs. 8AM – 5PM 
 Admission: Free The Springfield Kennel Club is an all breed dog club in th
 e Springfield\, Massachusetts area. We are a member club of the American K
