DESCRIPTION:Will Noonan is one of Boston’s most recognizable comedy star
 s\, known for his energetic storytelling\, sharp observations\, and unmist
 akable New England humor. Named “Boston’s Best Comedian” by The Impr
 oper Bostonian\, Will has appeared on FOX\, Hulu\, Gotham Comedy Live\, NP
 R’s This American Life\, and in the Netflix film The Sleepover. He is al
 so familiar to audiences across New England as “The Honda Guy” from hi
 s popular television and radio commercials. Joining him is feature comedia
 n Will Smalley\, a standout voice in the Boston comedy scene known for his
  clever\, personal\, and refreshingly original comedy. Boston comedian Rya
 n Ellington will host the evening and keep the laughs and energy flowing f
 rom start to finish. Grab your tickets early for a night packed with some 
 of New England’s funniest talent. Doors open at 7pm & the show starts at
  8 pm. To buy tickets\, click the button below\, or call 508-274-2190 for 
 further details. BUY TICKETS\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamber\nEvent page: htt
 ps://www.capecodchamber.org/event/comedian-will-noonan-at-the-sea-crest-be
 ach-resort/52520/
LOCATION:Sea Crest Beach Resort\, 350 Quaker Rd\, North Falmouth\, MA\, 02
 556
URL:https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/comedian-will-noonan-at-the-sea-c
 rest-beach-resort/52520/
