 ’s TOP 40 Hits\, such as: Crumblin Down\, Jackie Brown Hurts So Good\, P
 lay Guitar Rain on the Scarecrow\, PaperInFire Small Town\, Cherry Bomb\, 
 Lonely Ol’ Night\, Authority Song Jack and Diane\, R.O.C.K. in the USA 
 – and of course – Pink Houses. John Mellencamp\, continual supporter o
 f the long-running FARM AID projects\, has graced us with these tunes of t
 rue Americana and daily life. Although originated from his beloved rural h
 eartland areas\, many of us can identify with his take on day to day life 
 regardless of our locations today. TICKETS\n\nSources: Explore Western Mas
