SUMMARY:The Eagles Experience
DTSTART:20261121T200000
DTEND:20261121T220000
DTSTAMP:20261027T170709Z
UID:637d157ee375c279840fe4046bc6de@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:The Eagles Experience aims to be the most authentic tribute sh
 ow to the Eagles available today. With a one-to-one lineup that reflects t
 he Eagles during their heyday in the late 1970s\, the members of the Eagle
 s Experience each emulate their respective “Eagle”\, playing the corre
 ct instrument and singing the songs as sung by their protege. Every member
  of the Eagles Experience is dedicated to presenting their part as accurat
 ely as possible and will provide you with an ultimate “Eagles Experience
 ” you will not soon forget. This tribute band only plays songs written a
 nd recorded by the Eagles as a band\, from their biggest hits to hidden ge
 ms. Thelarcom.org/eagles\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page: https://
 northofboston.org/event/the-eagles-experience-5/
