DTEND:20261122T120000
DTSTAMP:20261027T170709Z
UID:c8ad80bd5d9c0f1e373c035b8d9836@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Join a Clark educator to explore An Exquisite Eye: Introducing
  the Aso O. Tavitian Collection \, featuring European painting\, sculpture
 \, and decorative arts from the Renaissance through the 19th century. Beyo
 nd the technical mastery of these works\, this tour examines how the Tavit
 ian Collection reflects a profound interest in the human experience. Capac
 ity is limited. Pick up a ticket at the Clark Center admissions desk\, ava
 ilable on a first-come\, first-served basis . Free with gallery admission.
