UID:715d192a47911f4a7e2fafa35b6902@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Bring your furry friends to Holyoke Mall on Monday & Tuesday\,
  November 23 & 24\, from 4:00 PM to 7:00 PM\, in Café Square\, for Pet Ni
