SUMMARY:Delaney House – Log Cabin\, Thanksgiving Dinner
DTSTART:20261126T110000
DTEND:20261126T160000
DTSTAMP:20261027T170709Z
UID:cbb0998dccdc61557e7c61b344cf1c@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Thanksgiving your way! Dine with us at The Log Cabin
  or Delaney House\, or take the feast to go! Hurry—our tables are fillin
