BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Christmas Carol Cocktail Experience at 52 Sumner
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261127
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261129
DTSTAMP:20261027T170709Z
UID:b4ad96df7193742b74a5d1c37d2318@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:This holiday season\, experience A Christmas Carol as you’ve
  never seen it before—with a dark and immersive twist on Charles Dickens
 ’ iconic ghost story. Condensed for maximum impact\, this reimagined per
 formance transports you to the heart of Victorian London\, following Ebene
 zer Scrooge on his spirited encounters. Along the way\, savor four holiday
 -inspired cocktails\, each thoughtfully paired with the evening’s chilli
 ng moments. Bah\, Humbug! Don’t miss this limited run of a captivating\,
  spirited adventure through a timeless classic. Get your tickets today for
  A Christmas Carol Cocktail Experience in Springfield\, MA! A Christmas Ca
 rol Cocktail Experience is a dark\, immersive reimagining of Dickens’ ti
 meless ghost story in Springfield\, MA—complete with a Victorian twist a
 nd four holiday-themed cocktails paired with key scenes. Don’t miss this
  spirited classic! 🎄 Highlights 👻 A Ghostly Descent: Step into Victo
 rian London as Scrooge\, Marley\, and the three spirits of Christmas are b
 rought to life before your eyes. 🍸 Sip the Spirits: Enjoy a curated tas
 ting menu of four holiday-themed cocktails\, paired perfectly with each sc
 ene of the night. 🎭 Immersive Theater: Lose yourself in a gripping\, at
 mospheric live performance of Dickens’ masterpiece\, condensed for maxim
 um impact. 🎁 The Perfect Gift: A meticulously crafted\, 90-minute eveni
 ng designed for anyone who likes their holiday magic with a darker edge. 
 📂 The Setlist: 4 Scenes\, 4 Cocktails Scene 1: A Ghostly Intro of Ebene
 zer Scrooge – Paired with Ebenezer’s Bitter Awakening Scene 2: Ghost o
 f Christmas Past – Paired with Past\, Present\, and Punch Scene 3: Ghost
  of Christmas Present – Paired with Ghostly Gold Cider Scene 4: Ghost of
  Christmas Future – Paired with Marley’s Marshmallow Martini Dates and
  times: Select your date & time directly in the ticket selector TICKETS\n
 \nSources: Explore Western Mass\nEvent page: https://explorewesternmass.co
 m/event/christmas-carol-cocktail-experience-at-52-sumner/
LOCATION:52 Sumner\, 52 Sumner Avenue\, Springfield\, MA\, 01108
URL:https://explorewesternmass.com/event/christmas-carol-cocktail-experien
 ce-at-52-sumner/
END:VEVENT
