 contact 413-253-2883 or holyoke.range@mass.gov Notch Visitor Center\, 1500
  West Street\, Amherst\, MA\n\nSources: Explore Western Mass\nEvent page: 
 https://explorewesternmass.com/event/amherst-mount-holyoke-range-walks/
