 ear\, Santa and Mrs. Claus will be visiting Magic Wings every weekend star
 ting the day after Thanksgiving! Join them to kick off a magical holiday s
 eason with a tree lighting in our Atrium at 10am on Saturday\, November 28
 . All visits with Santa and Mrs. Claus are free and everyone is welcome. G
 eneral visits with Santa and Mrs. Claus are on a first come\, first served
  basis. We have quiet visits by appointment for kiddos who need a quieter 
