DESCRIPTION:The Springfield Boys & Girls Club’s Festival of Trees return
 s to the MassMutual Center November 27 through December 13. Discover hundr
 eds of beautifully decorated trees\, enter raffles to win incredible prize
 s\, enjoy family-friendly activities\, visit Santa\, and create lasting ho
 liday memories. Every visit helps support the Springfield Boys & Girls Clu
 b and the young people it serves. Learn more at treeraffle.com. Kicking of
 f the day after Thanksgiving\, the Boys & Girls Clubs of Springfield opens
  the Annual Festival of Trees – open Thursday through Sunday. Presented 
 by the Springfield Boys & Girls Club\, this magical event transforms the M
 assMutual Center Convention Center’s Meeting Rooms into a winter wonderl
 and filled with beautifully decorated trees\, festive cheer\, and holiday 
 spirit. Each dazzling tree is donated by local businesses\, organizations
 \, and individuals\, with proceeds directly supporting programs at the Spr
 ingfield Boys & Girls Club — from after-school enrichment and mentoring 
 to athletics\, arts\, and leadership opportunities for Springfield youth. 
 Come experience the wonder\, support a great cause. Tickets SANTA’S HOUR
 S: Friday- Sunday 12:00 PM – 4:00 PM Children 12 & Under: FREE! FREE ADM
 ISSION TO ALL FRIDAY\, NOVEMBER 27TH. No ticket required.\n\nSources: Expl
 ore Western Mass\nEvent page: https://explorewesternmass.com/event/massmut
 ual-center-annual-festival-of-trees/2026-11-29/
