BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Cape Ann Big Band Holiday
DTSTART:20261204T190000
DTEND:20261204T210000
DTSTAMP:20261027T170709Z
UID:d3fcdb587af97290485d30ea5edff7@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy the holidays with holiday favorites\, old and new\, infu
 sed with a bit of jazz\, swing\, and rock n’ roll. In just a short span 
 of time\, the Cape Ann Big Band has become one of the most sought-after en
 sembles in the North Shore. “In just a short span of time\, the Cape Ann
  Big Band has become one of the most sought after ensembles in the North S
 hore and Greater Boston area selling out 23 consecutive shows at the Shali
 n Liu Performance Center in Rockport\, Ma. ” – Gloucester Daily Times 
 Enjoy the holidays with Cape Ann’s own 17-piece big band performing holi
 day favorites\, old and new\, infused with a bit of jazz\, swing\, and roc
 k n’ roll. In just a short span of time\, the Cape Ann Big Band has beco
 me one of the most sought-after ensembles in the North Shore. The Band was
  formed in December of 2010 when director Carlos Menezes Jr. teamed up wit
 h friends and fellow musicians Paula Burns\, Shawn Lowe\, Mike Lentini\, a
 nd Rick Geraghty to discuss the potentials of starting up a 17-piece big b
 and. What was once a dream quickly became reality when Menezes found the r
 oster full in just a week’s time. Driven by the talents of local musicia
 ns\, the Cape Ann Big Band prides itself in performing to entertain and co
 nnect with its local community. This is a group that truly operates as a f
 amily. This diverse big band entertains and delights audiences with dancea
 ble music infused with jazz\, swing\, New Orleans street bands\, soul\, an
 d rock n’ roll that will bring you back in time. The Cape Ann Big Band p
 rides itself with having a repertoire that has no boundaries.\n\nSources: 
 North of Boston\nEvent page: https://northofboston.org/event/cape-ann-big-
 band-holiday-3/2026-12-04/
LOCATION:Shalin Liu Performance Center\, 37 Main Street\, Rockport\, MA\, 
 01966
URL:https://northofboston.org/event/cape-ann-big-band-holiday-3/2026-12-04
 /
END:VEVENT
