DESCRIPTION:Prepare to be thunderstruck by the “True AC/DC Experience”
  brought to life by BACK IN BLACK! Since 1990\, they’ve been tearing up 
 stages across the United States\, delivering the electrifying legacy of AC
 /DC. With an astonishing repertoire of over 80 AC/DC hits\, they’re guar
 anteed to keep you rocking all night. What sets them apart is their master
 y of AC/DC’s lesser-known gems like “It’s A Long Way To The Top\,”
  “Overdose\,” and “Down Payment Blues.” Their high-octane live sho
 w\, top-tier sound\, and spot-on song reproduction will leave you craving 
 more. BACK IN BLACK is the one and only TRUE AC/DC EXPERIENCE. Don’t mis
 s your chance to feel the pulsating energy of their rock performance first
 hand! Thelarcom.org/backinblack\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page: h
