DESCRIPTION:Santa and Mrs. Claus come to Magic Wings Sprinkle a little ext
 ra magic into the holiday season with a visit to see Santa and Mrs. Claus 
 at Magic Wings! The holiday season is right around the corner and\, this y
 ear\, Santa and Mrs. Claus will be visiting Magic Wings every weekend star
 ting the day after Thanksgiving! Join them to kick off a magical holiday s
 eason with a tree lighting in our Atrium at 10am on Saturday\, November 28
 . All visits with Santa and Mrs. Claus are free and everyone is welcome. G
 eneral visits with Santa and Mrs. Claus are on a first come\, first served
  basis. We have quiet visits by appointment for kiddos who need a quieter 
 environment with less stimulation. Quiet visits available by appointment o
 n the individual event pages. Click on the date you are interested in to s
 chedule your quiet visit . Visits with Santa and Mrs. Claus : November 28
 \, 10am-1pm (No quiet visits) November 29\, 11am-2pm (No quiet visits) Dec
 ember 5 & 6\, 10am-12pm (Quiet visits 10am-11am) December 12 & 13\, 10am-2
 pm (Quiet visits 10am-11am) December 19 & 20\, 10am-2pm (Quiet visits 10am
 -11am) Free for everyone\n\nSources: Explore Western Mass\nEvent page: htt
