DTEND:20261206T190000
DTSTAMP:20261027T170709Z
UID:289ffec7fe7b322d622045a4ef035e@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Supper with Santa is a special night of Bright Nights combined
  with a family-friendly dinner with the big man in the red suit at the his
 toric Barney Carriage House. Every child is going to leave with a big smil
 e\, memories to share\, and a souvenir “I had Supper with Santa” mug. 
 The dinners on Sunday\, December 6th\, Friday\, December 11th\, and Sunday
 \, December 13th feature a table set for each reservation\, and an extra c
 hair for Santa. The buffet menu includes a winter salad with cranberry vin
 aigrette\, macaroni and cheese\, chicken tenders with sauces\, ziti marina
 ra\, breadsticks\, rolls\, hot chocolate\, juice boxes\, coffee\, and tea.
  For dessert\, there are scrumptious Christmas cookies and brownies. Ticke
 ts are $30 each. Children under 12 are $15 each\, and children under 2 are
  free. Tickets are purchased online at brightnights.org . Paid reservation
 s receive ONE complimentary Bright Nights at Forest Park vehicle admission
 . If additional tickets are required for the reservation\, they are availa
 ble at $15 each plus $2 ticket fee. RESERVATIONS Personal cameras are welc
 ome so you can capture the moment. Seatings 5:30PM 6:00PM 6:30PM 7:00PM Br
 ight Nights Named Best of the Best Since 1995\, Bright Nights has been a u
 nique public/private collaboration between the City of Springfield’s Dep
 artment of Parks\, Buildings & Recreation Management and the Spirit of Spr
 ingfield\, a private non-profit organization. Together they have welcomed 
 more than 6 million visitors. It has been calculated that if every bus tha
 t had visited were lined bumper to bumper\, they would go from Springfield
  to Cape Cod. The cars would go as far as California. BUY TICKETS\n\nSourc
 es: Explore Western Mass\nEvent page: https://explorewesternmass.com/event
 /bright-nights-at-forest-park-supper-with-santa/
LOCATION:Forest Park\, 300 Sumner Avenue\, Springfield\, MA\, 01108
URL:https://explorewesternmass.com/event/bright-nights-at-forest-park-supp
 er-with-santa/
END:VEVENT
