 ’d like to paint a beautiful glass ornament to add to your collection? C
 ome learn how to paint mandala holiday bulbs. Belchertown artist\, Gretche
 n Holesovsky\, will guide you in the beautiful possibilities in creating y
 our own holiday memory. Join Gretchen at the Mill District Local Art Galle
 ry on Sunday\, December 6 for this two-hour workshop. Each student will le
 arn the skill of mandala dot painting and apply it to a glass bulb of thei
 r choice. Gretchen will guide you in planning your design\, and share tips
