DESCRIPTION:A street with a remarkable history! Join a Cape Ann Museum doc
 ent for a fascinating stroll along historic Middle Street in downtown Glou
 cester. Discover the people\, places\, and events that shaped this iconic 
 neighborhood. Tours begin in the Cape Ann Museum lobby\, last approximatel
 y 45 minutes\, and are offered twice during the day at 11:00 a.m. and 1:00
  p.m. The Museum is free and open to the public all day\, making it the pe
 rfect destination for holiday fun. Create festive ornaments\, explore insp
 iring exhibitions\, tour historic Middle Street\, and celebrate the season
  with family and friends. Be sure to visit the Museum Store\, stocked with
  a distinctive selection of holiday gifts for everyone on your list. Cape 
 Ann Museum members receive 10% to 20% off purchases\, so it’s a great ti
 me to join or renew your membership. The Cape Ann Museum is proud to partn
 er with the Middle Street Walk\, inviting visitors to enjoy a full day of 
 festive activities\, history\, shopping\, and holiday cheer in the heart o
 f downtown Gloucester.\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page: https://no
 rthofboston.org/event/middle-street-walking-tour/2026-12-12/1/
