DESCRIPTION:Nashville-based singer-songwriter Liz Longley is taking her mu
 sic on the road this holiday season for a very special first-ever Christma
 s tour. Known for her stop-you-in-your-tracks voice and deeply personal so
 ngwriting\, Liz is embarking on this journey in support of her forthcoming
  EP\, The Holiday Fuss – a collection of original songs that capture the
  warmth\, chaos\, and magic of the season. “…from Americana and Gospel
 -flavored soul to shimmering Pop anthems and touches of Jazz.” – BILLB
 OARD After releasing her debut Christmas EP A Little Magic in 2020\, Liz a
 dds a second holiday collection to her catalog\, deepening her love for th
 e season and the stories it inspires. For fans who have followed Liz throu
 gh albums like Funeral For My Past and New Life\, this is a rare and intim
 ate opportunity to experience her in a completely different light – fest
 ive\, joyful\, and full of the same emotional depth that has made her one 
 of Americana/folk’s most beloved voices.\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEv
 ent page: https://northofboston.org/event/liz-longley-2/
LOCATION:Shalin Liu Performance Center\, 37 Main Street\, Rockport\, MA\, 
 01966
URL:https://northofboston.org/event/liz-longley-2/
