  Character Appearances Official RMS Mystery Squishy Dumpling Giveaway (fir
 st 3\,000 fans) Maybe YOU will get the rare Boomer dumpling! The Springfie
 ld Thunderbirds\, the proud American Hockey League affiliate of the St. Lo
 uis Blues. The T-Birds will be celebrating their 10th year as an AHL membe
 r club during the upcoming campaign\, as well as their sixth playing seaso
 n in affiliation with the Blues. Springfield has qualified for the Calder 
 Cup Playoffs in three of its past four seasons. Springfield Thunderbirds f
 ans are encouraged to visit www.SpringfieldThunderbirds.com to learn more 
 about Ticket Memberships\, which feature the best benefits\, including a s
 pecial edition season ticket holder jersey. For more information or to ord
 er now\, call (413) 739-GOAL (4625) or visit www.SpringfieldThunderbirds.c
 om .\n\nSources: Explore Western Mass\nEvent page: https://explorewesternm
 ass.com/event/springfield-thunderbirds-ahl-game-night-15/
