SUMMARY:MassMutual Center\, Harlem Globetrotters
DTSTART:20261229T180000
DTEND:20261229T210000
DTSTAMP:20261027T170709Z
UID:0639366ab7745e65347fb73b323800@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:HARLEM GLOBETROTTERS: RIVALRY TOUR The world-famous Harlem Glo
 betrotters are bringing a whole new game to Springfield when the Harlem Gl
 obetrotters: Rivalry Tour comes to the MassMutual Center on Tuesday\, Dece
 mber 29\, 2026 ! Have the Harlem Globetrotters finally met their match? NE
 W Rivals. NEW on-court challenges. NEW ways to be a part of the action! Th
 e Washington Generals and a new lineup of rivals step onto the court – h
 ungry for a win\, and out to prove it! The Harlem Globetrotters are coming
  to Springfield and bringing the HEAT! This is a whole new experience – 
 you’re not just watching\, you’re part of it. You help decide. Get pul
 led onto the court. Join the squad. Own the jumbotron. Because anything ca
 n happen at a Globetrotters game. And this year\, the fun starts before th
 e game even begins! Every ticket includes access to an all-new pre-game ti
 p-off party \, where fans can get in on the action before the Globetrotter
 s take the court. PREMIUM FAN EXPERIENCES Want to get even closer to the a
 ction? Upgrade your experience with exclusive fan opportunities: Ultimate 
 Fan Pass – NEW! Be among the first fans inside the arena with 30 minutes
  of exclusive\, first-look on-court access with the Harlem Globetrotters b
 efore doors open to the public. MVP Court Pass – NEW! Join the Harlem Gl
 obetrotters on the court in the moments before the game begins and experie
 nce the excitement from a whole new perspective. VIP Bench Tickets It does
 n’t get much closer than this! Sit on the bench for the entire game and 
 get a front-row view of every play. Choose your side with a Globetrotters 
 VIP Bench or Rivals VIP Bench ticket. The Globetrotters\, Washington Gener
 als\, and a new lineup of rivals will also debut fresh game uniforms and m
 erchandise for the Rivalry Tour. Fans can also check out the limited-editi
 on Harlem Globetrotters Rivals Replica Game Ball by Spalding® \, celebrat
 ing 75 years of the legendary Globetrotters-Washington Generals rivalry. T
 he rivalry is theirs. The thrill is yours. TICKETS\n\nSources: Explore Wes
 tern Mass\nEvent page: https://explorewesternmass.com/event/massmutual-cen
 ter-harlem-globetrotters/
LOCATION:MassMutual Center\, 1277 Main Street\, Springfield\, MA\, 01103
URL:https://explorewesternmass.com/event/massmutual-center-harlem-globetro
 tters/
