BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Legend of Ozzy
DTSTART:20270109T200000
DTEND:20270109T220000
DTSTAMP:20261027T170709Z
UID:2a1758d65a81ccd2560164fd7c7a64@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:LEGEND OF OZZY brings you an outstanding Ozzy show that recrea
 tes both the sound and visual appeal of Ozzy’s early very successful sol
 o days\, with a performance of many songs from Ozzy’s first 2 albums of 
 the Randy Rhoads era\, plus other later Ozzy hits as well as some legendar
 y early Black Sabbath favorites. LEGEND OF OZZY is – Alice Izzy\, lead g
 uitar\, Berklee grad\, guitar instructor\, session guitarist\, known for h
 er ferocious playing at live shows and to a massive online audience. Alice
  delivers top-notch accuracy and recreation of Randy Rhoads\, Jake E Lee\,
  Zakk Wylde\, and Tony Iommi playing styles\; Mark George\, drums\, also w
 ith the Joe Stump solo band\, the Gia G band on Sliptrick Records\, and in
  several other successful rock tribute bands with an extensive following\;
  Kevin Kelleher\, bass guitar\, Berklee grad with roots in the Bay Area\, 
 session/touring bassist\, also with Powerglove of E1 Music/MNRK Music Grou
 p\; Jeff Stark\, vocals\, also with the touring and recording band Adamant
 is on No Remorse Records. Trained by Pamela Moore\, vocalist and performer
  on Queensryche’s Suite Sister Mary\, Jeff is know for his high-energy l
 ive performances and powerful vocal impact with dynamic range\, and he del
 ivers an outstanding recreation of Ozzy’s look\, act\, and sound.\n\nSou
 rces: North of Boston\nEvent page: https://northofboston.org/event/legend-
 of-ozzy/
LOCATION:The Cut\, 177 Main Street\, Gloucester\, MA\, 01930
URL:https://northofboston.org/event/legend-of-ozzy/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:MassMutual Center\, Monster Truck X Tour
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270109
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270110
DTSTAMP:20261027T170709Z
UID:60f9c1682bd5d809467898a90fd4f0@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Springfield will be motorsport entertainment’s epicenter wit
 h the nation’s most competitive MONSTER TRUCKS as they invade the MassMu
 tual Center on January 9th for TWO Monster shows! See these incredible 10
 \,000-pound\, car crushing giants compete in racing\, wheelie contests\, a
 nd then rock the house with amazing freestyle action during the Monster X 
 Tour! Plus\, you can see the trucks up close at the pre-event Pit Party! S
 aturday\, January 9th\, 2027 Show: 1:00 PM & 7:00 PM VIP TICKET HOLDERS GE
 T EXCLUSIVE 30-MINUTE EARLY PIT PARTY ENTRY! PIT PARTY & DRIVER AUTOGRAPH 
 SESSION Come early\, meet the drivers\, get autographs\, and take photos w
 ith the drivers and their Monsters. Pit Party Pass must be accompanied by 
 an event ticket. RIDE TRUCK Get the ride of your life on-board a real Mons
 ter Truck during the Pit Party and Intermission! TICKETS\n\nSources: Explo
 re Western Mass\nEvent page: https://explorewesternmass.com/event/massmutu
 al-center-monster-truck-x-tour/
LOCATION:MassMutual Center\, 1277 Main Street\, Springfield\, MA\, 01103
URL:https://explorewesternmass.com/event/massmutual-center-monster-truck-x
 -tour/
END:VEVENT
