 r sixth playing season in affiliation with the Blues. Springfield has qual
 ified for the Calder Cup Playoffs in three of its past four seasons. Sprin
 gfield Thunderbirds fans are encouraged to visit www.SpringfieldThunderbir
 ds.com to learn more about Ticket Memberships\, which feature the best ben
 efits\, including a special edition season ticket holder jersey. For more 
 information or to order now\, call (413) 739-GOAL (4625) or visit www.Spri
 ngfieldThunderbirds.com .\n\nSources: Explore Western Mass\nEvent page: ht
