BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:MGM Springfield\, Roar! Comedy Club
DTSTART:20270115T200000
DTEND:20270115T220000
DTSTAMP:20261027T170709Z
UID:602c213fcb2e1492de91fb92385780@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Steve Furey Friday\, January 15\, 2027 – 8:00 PM Steve Furey
  is quickly emerging as one of the sharpest stand-up comedians in the come
 dy world. Fresh off a three-year run performing in arena tours as the open
 er for Bert Kreischer\, Furey is a paid regular at The World Famous Comedy
  Store\, the Hollywood Improv\, and Joe Rogan’s Comedy Mothership in Aus
 tin. He has been a featured performer at prestigious comedy festivals such
  as SF Sketchfest\, Moontower\, JFL Montreal\, New York Comedy Festival an
 d Netflix Is a Joke Fest. Steve was just recently chosen as a 2025 New Fac
 e at the prestigious Just For Laughs Festival in Montreal. He can currentl
 y be seen on Hulu\, as a co-host of Dating #NoFilter and on Iliza Shlesing
 er’s Locals Only. He has been featured on popular podcasts like Dumb Peo
 ple Town with the Sklar Brothers\, WTF with Marc Maron\, KFC Radio on Bars
 tool and Something’s Burning with Bert Kreischer. Additionally\, Steve h
 as a hit set on Don’t Tell Comedy’s YouTube channel. He hosts two hit 
 sold-out monthly shows at The Comedy Store—Steve Furey + Cronies and Com
 edy Confidential—and has toured with renowned comics such as Andrew Sant
 ino\, Theo Von\, Bobby Lee\, and more. BUY TICKETS MGM Springfield is the 
 place to go for laughs. The unique comedy series developed by John Tobin P
 resents\, features an eclectic mix of nationally popular comedians as well
  as rising industry stars. Upcoming Performances\n\nSources: Explore Weste
 rn Mass\nEvent page: https://explorewesternmass.com/event/mgm-springfield-
 roar-comedy-club-6/
LOCATION:MGM Springfield\, One MGM Way\, Springfield\, MA\, 01103
URL:https://explorewesternmass.com/event/mgm-springfield-roar-comedy-club-
 6/
END:VEVENT
