BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Symphony Hall\, Swan Lake
DTSTART:20270221T190000
DTEND:20270221T210000
DTSTAMP:20261027T170709Z
UID:b5416bfbc95f48a84f6757f23bedf7@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Experience the world’s most beloved ballet like never before
 . International Ballet Stars returns with a breathtaking production set to
  Tchaikovsky’s iconic score and performed by a world-class international
  cast representing four continents. From the moonlit lakeside where Prince
 ss Odette is held under a powerful spell\, to the dazzling royal ballroom 
 where the seductive Odile delivers the legendary 32 fouettés – every sc
 ene is filled with drama\, precision\, and unforgettable beauty. This larg
 e-scale\, immersive\, Broadway-caliber production brings together over 150
  handcrafted costumes\, richly detailed sets\, and an exceptional company 
 of dancers to create a spectacular live experience. Buy Tickets\n\nSources
 : Explore Western Mass\nEvent page: https://explorewesternmass.com/event/s
 ymphony-hall-swan-lake/
LOCATION:Symphony Hall\, 34 Court Street\, Springfield\, MA\, 01103
URL:https://explorewesternmass.com/event/symphony-hall-swan-lake/
END:VEVENT
