SUMMARY:Springfield Thunderbirds AHL Game Night
DTSTART:20270310T180000
DTEND:20270310T210000
DTSTAMP:20261027T170709Z
UID:86d58043bb7dde4202c6417f065ece@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:HOME GAME VS Charlotte Checkers Dropkick Murphys Postgame Conc
 ert @ Exhibition Hall Specialty Jersey Game The Dropkick Murphys are shipp
 ing up to Springfield for a postgame concert on Wednesday\, March 10\, wit
 h the concert beginning approximately 30 minutes after the T-Birds game ag
 ainst the Checkers. Please note\, this is a COMBO TICKET PACKAGE-ONLY EVEN
 T — the concert is not sold separately. Fans must purchase a T-Birds Gam
 e + Dropkick Murphys Concert Combo Ticket to attend. The Springfield Thund
 erbirds\, the proud American Hockey League affiliate of the St. Louis Blue
 s. The T-Birds will be celebrating their 10th year as an AHL member club d
 uring the upcoming campaign\, as well as their sixth playing season in aff
 iliation with the Blues. Springfield has qualified for the Calder Cup Play
 offs in three of its past four seasons. Springfield Thunderbirds fans are 
 encouraged to visit www.SpringfieldThunderbirds.com to learn more about Ti
 cket Memberships\, which feature the best benefits\, including a special e
 dition season ticket holder jersey. For more information or to order now\,
  call (413) 739-GOAL (4625) or visit www.SpringfieldThunderbirds.com .\n\n
 Sources: Explore Western Mass\nEvent page: https://explorewesternmass.com/
 event/springfield-thunderbirds-ahl-game-night-18/
LOCATION:MassMutual Center\, 1277 Main Street\, Springfield\, MA\, 01103
URL:https://explorewesternmass.com/event/springfield-thunderbirds-ahl-game
 -night-18/
