DESCRIPTION:Experience some of the most beloved choral music ever written 
 in one unforgettable concert. From the inspiring Hallelujah Chorus to othe
 r audience favorites\, this program celebrates the power of voices and orc
 hestra coming together. As a special highlight\, members of the Springfiel
 d Symphony Youth Orchestra will join the Springfield Symphony Orchestra mu
 sicians for a special side-by-side performance\, showcasing the next gener
 ation of musical talent. Go online or contact the Box Office to purchase y
 our tickets today!\n\nSources: Explore Western Mass\nEvent page: https://e
 xplorewesternmass.com/event/springfield-symphony-orchestra-favorite-choral
