BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Eastern States Exposition\, Hooplandia!
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270625
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270628
DTSTAMP:20261027T170709Z
UID:1d710e809840364e5f695002d41905@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Springfield\, Massachusetts is the birthplace of basketball an
 d it’s GAME ON for HOOPLANDIA\, the largest 3×3 basketball competition 
 and celebration on the East Coast and hosted by Eastern States Exposition 
 and the Naismith Memorial Basketball Hall of Fame. Hooplandia is not only 
 the Northeast’s first-ever 3×3 basketball tournament for both recreatio
 nal and elite players but also an all-inclusive festival jam-packed with e
 xperiences for attendees of all ages! Most games will be played on the ESE
  grounds\, with special games held at the Hall of Fame. Seventy-five baske
 tball courts will be set up to accommodate more than 650 games played by a
 pproximately 2\,100 participants of all ages. Divisions of play have been 
 created to provide an all-inclusive environment for players of all ages an
 d playing abilities. The diverse divisions include young girls\, boys\, wo
 men\, men\, high-school-level\, college-level\, OGs\, veterans\, and more.
  Players are invited to build teams of four\, create their own unique team
  name and uniforms\, and register at www.hooplandia.com . Team fees range 
 according to age\, and children in the under-8 category are free of charge
 . Weekend Event Schedule Event Highlights: 3-on-3 Basketball Tournaments B
 asketball Clinics Live Entertainment Food Trucks and Vendors Family Activi
 ties Merchandise and More Get ready for the kickoff of Hooplandia\, the No
 rtheast’s Ultimate 3×3 Basketball Tourney + Festival\, powered by Hoop 
 it Up. Our festivities commence on Friday\, June 20\, with Hooptacular\, a
 n evening filled with skills challenges and rivalry games\, free for all p
 articipants . The courts will be buzzing with excitement as players showca
 se their skills and compete in various challenges. What happens if it rain
 s? We’ve got you covered\, literally! We have indoor courts painted thro
 ughout our buildings in the event that it rains\, and the outdoor courts a
 re deemed unplayable. Where do I park? * Gate 9 Public Parking\, located a
 t 875 Memorial Avenue West Springfield\, MA 01089 * PLEASE NOTE: Our Gate 
 9 Public Parking Lot will be the only lot available for participants and s
 pectators to park in. All other gates will be closed. Spectators are welco
 me to watch the action! Admission to Hooplandia is free all weekend\, and 
 parking at Gate 9 is $10 on Saturday and Sunday.\n\nSources: Explore Weste
 rn Mass\nEvent page: https://explorewesternmass.com/event/eastern-states-e
 xposition-hooplandia/
LOCATION:Eastern States Exposition\, 1305 Memorial Avenue\, West Springfie
 ld\, MA\, 01089
